ecurity-in-vulnerable-areas/articleshow/135051822.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135051822.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Manipur's chief minister Y Khemchand Singh condemned the killing of three civilians by suspected militants on Monday. Protesters placed the bodies outside the chief minister's residence, prompting police to intervene. Security forces launched a combing operation to apprehend the assailants, employing sniffer dogs and helicopters for assistance. Violence also erupted a day prior in Thoubal, leaving one person dead during community clashes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-violence-cm-condemns-killing-of-three-civilians-orders-tighter-security-in-vulnerable-areas/articleshow/135051822.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-violence-cm-condemns-killing-of-three-civilians-orders-tighter-security-in-vulnerable-areas/articleshow/135051822.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T21:26:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135051897,imgsize-1230593.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Feeling strong?' Abhijeet Dipke targets PM Modi after Das &amp; Ranka's judicial custody extended, shares photo]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/feeling-strong-abhijeet-dipke-targets-pm-modi-after-das-rankas-judicial-custody-extended-shares-photo/articleshow/135051633.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135051633.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/feeling-strong-abhijeet-dipke-targets-pm-modi-after-das-rankas-judicial-custody-extended-shares-pho